# Checklists

Release and per-feature gates only; detailed standards live in owner files in [`index.mdc`](./index.mdc).

## Release readiness

- [ ] Structure, layer boundaries, and dependencies must match their owner rules.
- [ ] Theme/tokens, components, and layouts must follow [`design-system.mdc`](./design-system.mdc), [`components.mdc`](./components.mdc), [`layouts.mdc`](./layouts.mdc).
- [ ] User-facing strings must not be hard-coded; `_FeatureText` copy classes must not be used.
- [ ] Layouts must adapt across mobile, tablet, desktop; colors, spacing, and typography must not be hard-coded.
- [ ] Reusable widgets must live in `frontend/lib/shared/`; the catalog should be checked first.
- [ ] Auth/permissions must align with backend entitlements; menus/routes/actions must be hidden for unauthorized users (RBAC+ABAC).
- [ ] UI/API must use `human_friendly_id` only ([`data_modeling.mdc`](./data_modeling.mdc)).
- [ ] Subscription ∩ role permission intersection must be enforced ([`permissions.mdc`](./permissions.mdc)).
- [ ] API integration must follow [`.cursor/api-contract.mdc`](../../.cursor/api-contract.mdc).
- [ ] `flutter analyze` and `flutter test` must pass ([`ci_cd_quality_gates.mdc`](./ci_cd_quality_gates.mdc)).

## Per-feature gate

- [ ] Features must use standard `data/domain/presentation` structure and should reuse shared components.
- [ ] Queue screens must follow [`ui-workspace.mdc`](./ui-workspace.mdc); feedback must follow [`ui-feedback.mdc`](./ui-feedback.mdc).
- [ ] Presentation must not expose raw UUIDs, enum codes, or magic constants.
- [ ] Shared-data mutations must follow [`instant_ui_sync.mdc`](./instant_ui_sync.mdc); cancel/failure must not patch or refresh.
- [ ] Tests must cover controller logic and critical UI.

